config BR2_PACKAGE_BATOCERA_PAUSE
	bool "batocera-pause"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_EVDEV
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PSUTIL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PYGAME2
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_DBUS_FAST		# controls limusic over MPRIS from the pause overlay's Music view
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_AIOHTTP		# downloads limusic's own album art
	help
	  A universal pause: holds the gamepad Guide button (or the keyboard Home key) as a
	  pause/resume hotkey for every emulator, independent of whatever quit hotkey that
	  emulator's own config happens to have. Freezes the whole running process tree
	  (SIGSTOP/SIGCONT) and shows a Resume/Quit screen while it's frozen, with a Music
	  view to control the background Limusic player (see the "limusic" package/service).
